{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34391","headline":"奉和袭美开元寺佛鉢诗 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美开元寺佛鉢诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空王初受逞神功，四鉢须臾现一重。\n持次想添香积饭，覆时应带步罗锺。\n光寒好照金毛鹿，响静堪降白耳龙。\n从此宝函香里见，不须西去诣灵峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}